"""Single source of truth for the Phase A rule register (audit/ALGO8_PHASE_A_RECONSTRUCTION_AUDIT.md).
Every row is taken from an existing report, code file or test result in this repository (column `sources`); no new experiment was run for the audit.
Writes audit/ALGO8_PHASE_A_RULE_REGISTER.csv and audit/ALGO8_PHASE_A_RULE_REGISTER.md.  Run from the repository root:  python3 audit/build_phase_a_register.py
Status vocabulary (fixed before filling the table):
  CONFIRMED  structure observed and near-deterministic in the log (>= ~90% of the relevant decisions), any residual is a detail
  DECODED    a rule is implemented and reproduces the behaviour with stated, imperfect accuracy
  PARTIAL    some structure is known (side, timing or form) but the trigger or size is not
  UNRESOLVED a specific question was investigated and has no accepted answer
  UNKNOWN    no evidence either way (not investigated, or not identifiable from the available data)
  CANDIDATE  a hypothesis that survived one pre-registered test but was formulated after observing the data, has a small sample and no independent confirmation; EXCLUDED from the baseline reconstruction, configurable candidate only
Evidence labels follow the repository convention: Observed (measured in the log), Inferred (reasoned from observations), Weak, Unresolved.
Gap class: E = could be investigated with data already in the repository, N = needs data we do not have, I = may be irreducible from fills + one-minute bars, - = no gap."""
